skill_gaps_summary: "The candidate lacks experience with key backend technologies required for the role, particularly FastAPI and related frameworks. There's no evidence of database expertise or API design experience. Additionally, with only 2 years of experience, they don't meet the senior-level requirement of 5+ years."
